{"id":"en_sacrifice-i-m-a-walking-armory","title":"Sacrifice? I'm a Walking Armory!","titleEn":"Sacrifice? I'm a Walking Armory!","description":"A young man from the modern era is transported to another world, where he finds himself cast as a human sacrifice. Just as things look bleakest, a weapon system awakens within him, granting him access to contemporary firearms such as Gatling guns and mortars. His path later crosses that of a female general, from whom he gains insight into the oppressive rule gripping this world. The question becomes whether he can rescue himself from his predicament, and whether he might also be able to free the people living under that tyranny. Those interested in following the series can find it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/sacrifice-im-a-walking-armory/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/sacrifice-im-a-walking-armory/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy World","Karma Payback","Time Travel","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlgq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_sacrifice-i-m-a-walking-armory_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlgq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sacrifice-i-m-a-walking-armory_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlgq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sacrifice-i-m-a-walking-armory_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjlgq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_sacrifice-i-m-a-walking-armory_4","title":"Episod